{% comment %}
  ZEOTEIN BLEND CHOOSER (Nov 16 2026, simplified 11:30 AM CT per Dana 11:09 AM CT)
  All-in-one chooser page: pick blend (when more than one), Subscribe or One-Time, then one product card.
  One simple choice per product: no 1/2/3 bundle tiers, no "pick 1, 2 or 3" step and no bundle savings line here.
  Multi-bag savings are shown ONLY on each product's own page (snippets/zt-buybox-tidy.liquid, part 'bundle').
  The button opens the real product page. Prices come from the products and their selling plans. Nothing is added to the cart here.
  Nov 16 2026 6:35 PM CT per Dana: no savings callouts on the size cards; each card shows only its real price.
  Photos are a swipeable gallery of the product's own images, shown in full (contain, not cropped).

  Nov 18 2026 (Jewels Roundtable section 08):
  - Nov 20 2026 2:13 PM CT (Dana): the "+ FREE STARTER KIT" / "+ 3 FREE GUIDES" pills on the size cards are removed.
    The selected-card gift line (snippets/zt-ch-perk.liquid) and the first-order list (Save-A-Scoop, 3 guides, and the rest) stay.
  - The old "Included free" box is replaced by a gift card (snippets/zt-ch-kit.liquid) listing each item with its struck price
    and FREE, with a value pill that follows the choice. Values are read live from the gift products:
    bag subscribe $62.98, sticks subscribe $55.99, bag one-time $46.99, sticks one-time $40, 7-Day $40 (Nov 18 2026).
  - Gifts per size come from the product unless the size block overrides them (kit_sub / kit_once).
  - Nov 20 2026 2:28 PM CT (Dana): the size-card "Free Starter Kit / 3 Free Guides · value" labels and the Continue button "+ Free Starter Kit" / "+ 3 Free Guides" suffix are removed. The button is the normal label plus the price. The what's-included box (zt-ch-kit) and the size-card included list (zt-ch-perk) stay.
  - The Zeotein FAQ (snippets/zt-faq-content.liquid) with FAQPage schema renders under the chooser (setting faq_set).

  Nov 20 2026 7:13 PM CT (Dana, via Orbit):
  - 7-Day is back to the simple card (no One-time box or pack tiers here). Pack tiers live only on the 7-Day product pages.
  - The big gift card under the chooser (zt-ch-kit) is replaced by ONE short line that follows the choice, e.g.
    "Free with your first subscription: shaker, Save-A-Scoop + 3 guides ($62.98 value)". The value is the sum of the gift
    products' own store prices, read live (shaker $15.99, Save-A-Scoop $6.99, Starter Guide $12, Cacao Recipe Guide $14,
    Vegan Recipe Guide $14 on Nov 20 2026): bag subscribe $62.98, sticks subscribe $55.99, bag one-time $46.99, 7-Day $40.
  - The selected card's own gift line ("With your first subscription: ...", snippets/zt-ch-perk.liquid) is removed, so the gift
    is said once, by the short line under the chooser (condense to one line).
  - Corner pill at the top left of the bulk bag card (any size whose product handle contains "bag"). Setting bulk_pill:
    Best Seller (default since Nov 20 2026: the Cacao bulk bag is the top seller by units and orders, last 60 and 90 days) /
    Best Value / none. Unpublished-theme preview only: ?zt_pill=best_seller / best_value / none switches it without saving.
  - Nov 20 2026 8:35 PM CT (Dana, via Orbit), /pages/protein-blends ONLY (template suffix zt-chooser-blends): the free
    gifts go back INSIDE the selected card as the light-purple inset box with the small gift image strip (zt-ch__perk, the
    pre-7:13 PM look), with the new wording, e.g. "Free with your first subscription: shaker, Save-A-Scoop + 3 guides
    ($62.98 value)". The one line under the cards is not shown there. Other pages using this section (shop-cacao, shop-vegan)
    are unchanged and keep the line under the cards.
  - Gallery position 4 on the Cacao cards (Dana 7:41 PM CT: not photo 2; photos 1-3 stay the product's first three, the ad
    image is 4th, the rest follow; a card with fewer than 3 photos gets it last). Cards: bulk bag, 30 sticks, 7-Day. Image: the Meta "Six clean ingredients" ad image (Shopify Files
    zeotein-meta-ad-six-clean-ingredients.jpg), per the Nov 18 2026 Jewels call to-do #19 ("Ingredient image ad onto the
    website ... Protein Blends gallery slot 2"). Live site only: this theme section is not used by the Google site (shop / GHL).
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign uid = 'zt-chooser-' | append: section.id
  assign blend_count = 0
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'blend'
      assign blend_count = blend_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
  assign first_blend = ''
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'blend' and first_blend == ''
      assign first_blend = b.settings.key
    endif
  endfor
  assign zt_pill = section.settings.bulk_pill | default: 'best_seller'
  assign zt_pill_value = section.settings.pill_value_label | default: 'Best Value'
  assign zt_pill_seller = section.settings.pill_seller_label | default: 'Best Seller'
  assign zt_pill_txt = zt_pill_value
  if zt_pill == 'best_seller'
    assign zt_pill_txt = zt_pill_seller
  endif
  assign zt_gb_card = false
  if template.suffix == 'zt-chooser-blends'
    assign zt_gb_card = true
  endif
  assign zl_shaker = all_products['zeotein-cleanblend-shaker-27oz-usa-made']
  assign zl_scoop = all_products['save-a-scoop']
  assign zl_g1 = all_products['zeotein-starter-guide']
  assign zl_g2 = all_products['cacao-recipe-guide']
  assign zl_g3 = all_products['vegan-recipe-guide']
  assign zt_ch_blend = false
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'option' and b.settings.product != blank
      if b.settings.product.tags contains 'protein-blend'
        assign zt_ch_blend = true
      endif
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- liquid
  comment
    Nov 24 2026: Black Friday window for the card prices, same as snippets/zt-bf-blend-price (Nov 24 12:00 AM to Nov 30 11:59 PM CT).
  endcomment
  assign ztbf_ch_start = 1795500000
  assign ztbf_ch_end = 1796104740
  assign ztbf_ch_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign ztbf_ch_hidden = true
  if ztbf_ch_now >= ztbf_ch_start and ztbf_ch_now < ztbf_ch_end
    assign ztbf_ch_hidden = false
  endif
-%}
<section id="{{ uid }}" class="zt-ch" data-zt-chooser data-mode="sub" data-blend="{{ first_blend | escape }}">
  <div class="zt-ch__inner">
    <div class="zt-ch__media">
      {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if b.type == 'option' and b.settings.product != blank -%}
          {%- assign p = b.settings.product -%}
          {%- assign zt_imgs = p.media | where: 'media_type', 'image' -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign zt_ad_img = nil
            if b.settings.blend == 'cacao' and zt_imgs.size > 0
              assign zt_ad_img = images['zeotein-meta-ad-six-clean-ingredients.jpg']
            endif
            assign zt_slides = zt_imgs.size
            if zt_ad_img
              assign zt_slides = zt_slides | plus: 1
            endif
            assign zt_ad_after = 3
            if zt_imgs.size < 3
              assign zt_ad_after = zt_imgs.size
            endif
          -%}
          <div class="zt-ch__img-wrap" data-zt-img="{{ b.id }}" {% unless forloop.first %}hidden{% endunless %}>
            <div class="zt-ch__gal" data-zt-gal tabindex="0" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="{{ b.settings.title | escape }} photos">
              {%- if zt_imgs.size > 0 -%}
                {%- for m in zt_imgs -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign zt_alt = m.alt | default: b.settings.title
                    assign zt_load = 'lazy'
                    if forloop.first
                      assign zt_load = 'eager'
                    endif
                  -%}
                  <div class="zt-ch__slide">
                    {{ m.preview_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: loading: zt_load, widths: '450, 700, 900, 1100', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw', class: 'zt-ch__img', alt: zt_alt }}
                  </div>
                  {%- if forloop.index == zt_ad_after and zt_ad_img -%}
                  <div class="zt-ch__slide zt-ch__slide--ad">
                    {{ zt_ad_img | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '450, 700, 900, 1100', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw', class: 'zt-ch__img', alt: 'Six clean ingredients in Zeotein Cacao: grass-fed bone broth protein, collagen peptides, cacao, MCT, sea moss and zeolite' }}
                  </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- elsif b.settings.image != blank -%}
                <div class="zt-ch__slide">{{ b.settings.image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', widths: '450, 700, 900, 1100', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw', class: 'zt-ch__img', alt: b.settings.title }}</div>
              {%- elsif p.featured_image -%}
                <div class="zt-ch__slide">{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', widths: '450, 700, 900, 1100', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 50vw, 100vw', class: 'zt-ch__img', alt: b.settings.title }}</div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            {%- if zt_slides > 1 -%}
              <button type="button" class="zt-ch__gal-btn zt-ch__gal-btn--prev" data-zt-gal-prev aria-label="Previous photo"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.5 4.5 7 10l5.5 5.5"/></svg></button>
              <button type="button" class="zt-ch__gal-btn zt-ch__gal-btn--next" data-zt-gal-next aria-label="Next photo"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7.5 4.5 13 10l-5.5 5.5"/></svg></button>
              <div class="zt-ch__dots">
                {%- for zt_d in (1..zt_slides) -%}
                  <button type="button" class="zt-ch__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-zt-dot="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Photo {{ forloop.index }} of {{ zt_slides }}"></button>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    <div class="zt-ch__panel">
      <h1 class="zt-ch__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }} {% if section.settings.heading_accent != blank %}<span>{{ section.settings.heading_accent }}</span>{% endif %}</h1>
      {%- if section.settings.intro != blank -%}<p class="zt-ch__intro">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.rating_text != blank -%}
        <p class="zt-ch__rating"><span class="zt-ch__stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> {{ section.settings.rating_text }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if blend_count > 1 -%}
        <p class="zt-ch__step" id="{{ uid }}-blend-label">{{ section.settings.blend_step }}</p>
        <div class="zt-ch__blends" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ uid }}-blend-label">
          {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if b.type == 'blend' -%}
              <button type="button" class="zt-ch__blend{% if b.settings.key == first_blend %} is-active{% endif %}" data-zt-blend-btn="{{ b.settings.key | escape }}" aria-pressed="{% if b.settings.key == first_blend %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
                <strong>{{ b.settings.label }}</strong>
                {%- if b.settings.sublabel != blank -%}<span>{{ b.settings.sublabel }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </button>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="zt-ch__step" id="{{ uid }}-mode-label">{{ section.settings.mode_step }}</p>
      <div class="zt-ch__modes" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ uid }}-mode-label">
        <button type="button" class="zt-ch__mode is-active" data-zt-mode-btn="sub" aria-pressed="true">{{ section.settings.subscribe_label }}</button>
        <button type="button" class="zt-ch__mode" data-zt-mode-btn="once" aria-pressed="false">{{ section.settings.onetime_label }}</button>
      </div>

      <div class="zt-chq" data-zt-qty hidden>{% comment %}Nov 26 2026 (Dana, AI CMO chat): Continue is gone. Bulk bag and 30 stick cards get HOW MANY? (1, 2, 3 with price per bag or box and the total); the button adds the product, quantity and Seal plan straight to the cart and opens /cart. Same math as snippets/zt-bundle-qty (tiers 0/10/20, Black Friday 30/37/44 in the data-ztbf window, percent off each unit rounded down to the cent). 7-Day stays quantity 1. If the add fails the shopper goes to the product page.{% endcomment %}<p class="zt-ch__step" id="{{ uid }}-qty-label">How many?</p><span class="zt-chq__bf" data-zt-q-bf hidden>+30% Black Friday savings <em>applied</em></span><div class="zt-chq__row" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="{{ uid }}-qty-label">{%- for zq_n in (1..3) -%}<button type="button" class="zt-chq__opt{% if zq_n == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if zq_n == 1 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-zt-q="{{ zq_n }}"><span class="zt-chq__n" data-zt-q-n></span><span class="zt-chq__save" data-zt-q-save></span><strong class="zt-chq__each" data-zt-q-each></strong><span class="zt-chq__tot" data-zt-q-tot></span></button>{%- endfor -%}</div></div><p class="zt-ch__step" id="{{ uid }}-size-label">{{ section.settings.size_step }}</p>
      <div class="zt-ch__options" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ uid }}-size-label">
        {%- assign first_done = false -%}
        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if b.type == 'option' and b.settings.product != blank -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign p = b.settings.product
              assign v = p.selected_or_first_available_variant
              assign once_price = v.price
              assign sub_price = nil
              assign plan_id = ''
              assign alloc = nil
              if b.settings.one_time_only == false
                if b.settings.selling_plan_id != blank
                  for a in v.selling_plan_allocations
                    assign aid = a.selling_plan.id | append: ''
                    if aid == b.settings.selling_plan_id
                      assign alloc = a
                    endif
                  endfor
                endif
                if alloc == nil
                  assign alloc = v.selling_plan_allocations.first
                endif
              endif
              if alloc
                assign sub_price = alloc.price
                assign plan_id = alloc.selling_plan.id
              endif
              comment
                Nov 21 2026 (Dana 9:39/9:42, Orbit B+C 10:03): main stick Subscribe = Starter Kit on the new $84.99 then $109.99
                plan. Show the new first-order price and open the PDP with zt_sub=1; part 'route' puts the new plan in the cart.
              endcomment
              assign zr_k = ''
              if p.handle == 'zeotein-cacao-sticks-30'
                assign zr_k = 'zeotein-cacao-sticks-30'
              elsif p.handle == 'zeotein-vegan-sticks-30'
                assign zr_k = 'zeotein-vegan-sticks-30'
              endif
              if zr_k != '' and b.settings.one_time_only == false
                assign zr_p = all_products[zr_k]
                assign zr_v = zr_p.selected_or_first_available_variant
                for a in zr_v.selling_plan_allocations
                  assign aid = a.selling_plan.id | append: ''
                  if aid == '6730842325'
                    assign sub_price = a.price
                    assign plan_id = 'route'
                  endif
                endfor
              endif
              assign is_first = false
              if b.settings.blend == first_blend and first_done == false
                assign is_first = true
                assign first_done = true
              endif
              assign k_sub = b.settings.kit_sub
              assign k_once = b.settings.kit_once
              if b.settings.one_time_only
                assign k_once = k_once | default: 'guides'
              elsif p.handle contains 'bag'
                assign k_sub = k_sub | default: 'shaker,scoop,guides'
                assign k_once = k_once | default: 'scoop,guides'
              else
                assign k_sub = k_sub | default: 'shaker,guides'
                assign k_once = k_once | default: 'guides'
              endif
            -%}
            {%- comment -%} Nov 24 2026 (Dana): Black Friday price on each card, regular price struck through. 30% off, discount rounded down to the cent (same math as snippets/zt-bf-blend-price). Subscribe = first month. Shown Nov 24 12:00 AM to Nov 30 11:59 PM CT by the data-ztbf window (zt-bf-countdown-sitewide); outside it the regular price shows. Display only. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign ztbf_sub = 0
                if sub_price
                  assign ztbf_sub = sub_price | times: 30 | divided_by: 100
                  assign ztbf_sub = sub_price | minus: ztbf_sub
                endif
                assign ztbf_once = once_price | times: 30 | divided_by: 100
                assign ztbf_once = once_price | minus: ztbf_once
              -%}
            <button type="button"
              class="zt-ch__opt{% if is_first %} is-active{% endif %}{% if sub_price == nil %} is-once-only{% endif %}"
              data-zt-opt="{{ b.id }}"
              data-blend="{{ b.settings.blend | escape }}"
              data-url="{{ p.url }}"
              data-plan="{{ plan_id }}" data-variant="{{ v.id }}" data-sub-c="{% if sub_price %}{{ sub_price }}{% endif %}" data-once-c="{{ once_price }}" data-unit="{% if p.handle contains 'bag' %}bag{% else %}box{% endif %}" data-tiered="{% if b.settings.one_time_only %}0{% else %}1{% endif %}"
              data-title="{{ b.settings.title | escape }}"
              data-once="{% if ztbf_ch_hidden %}{{ once_price | money | escape }}{% else %}{{ ztbf_once | money | escape }}{% endif %}"
              data-sub="{% if sub_price %}{% if ztbf_ch_hidden %}{{ sub_price | money | escape }}{% else %}{{ ztbf_sub | money | escape }}{% endif %}{% endif %}"
              aria-pressed="{% if is_first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
              {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
              {%- if p.handle contains 'bag' -%}<span class="zt-ch__pill" data-zt-pill data-value="{{ zt_pill_value | escape }}" data-seller="{{ zt_pill_seller | escape }}"{% if zt_pill == 'none' %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ zt_pill_txt }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              <span class="zt-ch__opt-thumb">
                {%- if p.featured_image -%}{{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' }}{%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="zt-ch__opt-body">
                <strong class="zt-ch__opt-title">{{ b.settings.title }}</strong>
                {%- if b.settings.description != blank -%}<span class="zt-ch__opt-desc">{{ b.settings.description }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if sub_price == nil -%}
                  <span class="zt-ch__opt-note">{{ section.settings.once_only_label }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="zt-ch__opt-price">
                {%- if sub_price -%}
                  <span class="zt-ch__sub-only"><span class="zt-ch__bf" data-ztbf-start="{{ ztbf_ch_start }}" data-ztbf-end="{{ ztbf_ch_end }}"{% if ztbf_ch_hidden %} hidden{% endif %}><s><span class="visually-hidden">Regular price </span>{{ sub_price | money }}</s><strong>{{ ztbf_sub | money }}</strong></span><strong class="zt-ch__reg">{{ sub_price | money }}</strong></span>
                  <span class="zt-ch__once-only"><span class="zt-ch__bf" data-ztbf-start="{{ ztbf_ch_start }}" data-ztbf-end="{{ ztbf_ch_end }}"{% if ztbf_ch_hidden %} hidden{% endif %}><s><span class="visually-hidden">Regular price </span>{{ once_price | money }}</s><strong>{{ ztbf_once | money }}</strong></span><strong class="zt-ch__reg">{{ once_price | money }}</strong></span>
                {%- else -%}
                  <span class="zt-ch__bf" data-ztbf-start="{{ ztbf_ch_start }}" data-ztbf-end="{{ ztbf_ch_end }}"{% if ztbf_ch_hidden %} hidden{% endif %}><s><span class="visually-hidden">Regular price </span>{{ once_price | money }}</s><strong>{{ ztbf_once | money }}</strong></span><strong class="zt-ch__reg">{{ once_price | money }}</strong>
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              {%- comment -%} Nov 20 2026 8:35 PM CT (Dana via Orbit): on /pages/protein-blends only, the gift is shown inside the selected card (light-purple inset box + gift image strip) with the new wording; elsewhere the line under the chooser stays. {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if zt_ch_blend and zt_gb_card -%}
                {%- if b.settings.one_time_only -%}
                  {%- assign zl_modes = 'trial' | split: ',' -%}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- assign zl_modes = 'sub,once' | split: ',' -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- for zl_m in zl_modes -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    case zl_m
                      when 'sub'
                        assign zl_csv = k_sub
                        assign zl_cls = 'zt-ch__sub-only'
                        assign zl_lead = 'Free with your first subscription'
                      when 'once'
                        assign zl_csv = k_once
                        assign zl_cls = 'zt-ch__once-only'
                        assign zl_lead = 'Free with your first order'
                      else
                        assign zl_csv = k_once
                        assign zl_cls = ''
                        assign zl_lead = 'Included with your 7-Day'
                    endcase
                    assign zl_list = zl_csv | remove: ' ' | split: ','
                    assign zl_value = 0
                    assign zl_names = ''
                    for g in zl_list
                      case g
                        when 'shaker'
                          assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_shaker.price
                          assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|shaker'
                        when 'scoop'
                          assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_scoop.price
                          assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|Save-A-Scoop'
                        when 'guides'
                          assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_g1.price | plus: zl_g2.price | plus: zl_g3.price
                          assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|3 guides'
                      endcase
                    endfor
                    assign zl_arr = zl_names | remove_first: '|' | split: '|'
                    assign zl_txt = ''
                    for nm in zl_arr
                      if forloop.first
                        assign zl_txt = nm
                      elsif forloop.last
                        assign zl_txt = zl_txt | append: ' + ' | append: nm
                      else
                        assign zl_txt = zl_txt | append: ', ' | append: nm
                      endif
                    endfor
                  -%}
                  {%- if zl_txt != '' -%}
                  <span class="zt-ch__perk zt-ch__perk--{{ zl_m }} {{ zl_cls }}" data-zt-kit-value="{{ zl_value | money_without_trailing_zeros }}">
                    <span class="zt-ch__perk-thumbs" aria-hidden="true">
                      {%- for g in zl_list -%}
                        {%- case g -%}
                          {%- when 'shaker' -%}{%- if zl_shaker.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ zl_shaker.featured_image | image_url: width: 72 }}" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
                          {%- when 'scoop' -%}{%- if zl_scoop.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ zl_scoop.featured_image | image_url: width: 72 }}" alt="" width="30" height="30" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
                          {%- when 'guides' -%}<span class="zt-ch__perk-fan">{%- for gg in (1..3) -%}{%- case gg -%}{%- when 1 -%}{%- assign gp = zl_g2 -%}{%- when 2 -%}{%- assign gp = zl_g3 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign gp = zl_g1 -%}{%- endcase -%}{%- if gp.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ gp.featured_image | image_url: width: 72, height: 96, crop: 'center' }}" alt="" width="20" height="28" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</span>
                        {%- endcase -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </span>
                    <span class="zt-ch__perk-txt">{{ zl_lead }}: {{ zl_txt }} <b>({{ zl_value | money_without_trailing_zeros }} value)</b></span>
                  </span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if b.settings.badge != blank -%}<span class="zt-ch__badge">{{ b.settings.badge }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- if zt_ch_blend and zt_gb_card == false -%}
      {%- capture zt_ch_gift_icon -%}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="7.5" width="14" height="3.5" rx=".8"/><path d="M4.5 11v5.5h11V11M10 7.5v9"/><path d="M10 7.5C8.8 4.7 5.4 4.1 5.4 6.2c0 1.3 2.3 1.3 4.6 1.3ZM10 7.5c1.2-2.8 4.6-3.4 4.6-1.3 0 1.3-2.3 1.3-4.6 1.3Z"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}
      <div class="zt-ch__kits">
        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if b.type == 'option' and b.settings.product != blank -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign k_h = b.settings.product.handle
              assign k_title = b.settings.kit_title
              assign k_sub = b.settings.kit_sub
              assign k_once = b.settings.kit_once
              if b.settings.one_time_only
                assign k_title = k_title | default: 'Your 3 FREE Guides'
                assign k_once = k_once | default: 'guides'
              else
                assign k_title = k_title | default: 'Your FREE Starter Kit'
                if k_h contains 'bag'
                  assign k_sub = k_sub | default: 'shaker,scoop,guides'
                  assign k_once = k_once | default: 'scoop,guides'
                else
                  assign k_sub = k_sub | default: 'shaker,guides'
                  assign k_once = k_once | default: 'guides'
                endif
              endif
            -%}
            <div data-zt-gifts="{{ b.id }}" {% unless forloop.first %}hidden{% endunless %}>
              {%- if b.settings.one_time_only -%}
                {%- assign zl_modes = 'trial' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- assign zl_modes = 'sub,once' | split: ',' -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- for zl_m in zl_modes -%}
                {%- liquid
                  case zl_m
                    when 'sub'
                      assign zl_csv = k_sub
                      assign zl_cls = 'zt-ch__sub-only'
                      assign zl_lead = 'Free with your first subscription'
                    when 'once'
                      assign zl_csv = k_once
                      assign zl_cls = 'zt-ch__once-only'
                      assign zl_lead = 'Free with your first order'
                    else
                      assign zl_csv = k_once
                      assign zl_cls = ''
                      assign zl_lead = 'Included with your 7-Day'
                  endcase
                  assign zl_list = zl_csv | remove: ' ' | split: ','
                  assign zl_value = 0
                  assign zl_names = ''
                  for g in zl_list
                    case g
                      when 'shaker'
                        assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_shaker.price
                        assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|shaker'
                      when 'scoop'
                        assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_scoop.price
                        assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|Save-A-Scoop'
                      when 'guides'
                        assign zl_value = zl_value | plus: zl_g1.price | plus: zl_g2.price | plus: zl_g3.price
                        assign zl_names = zl_names | append: '|3 guides'
                    endcase
                  endfor
                  assign zl_arr = zl_names | remove_first: '|' | split: '|'
                  assign zl_txt = ''
                  for nm in zl_arr
                    if forloop.first
                      assign zl_txt = nm
                    elsif forloop.last
                      assign zl_txt = zl_txt | append: ' + ' | append: nm
                    else
                      assign zl_txt = zl_txt | append: ', ' | append: nm
                    endif
                  endfor
                -%}
                {%- if zl_txt != '' -%}
                <p class="zt-ch__giftline {{ zl_cls }}" data-zt-kit-value="{{ zl_value | money_without_trailing_zeros }}">{{ zt_ch_gift_icon }}<span>{{ zl_lead }}: {{ zl_txt }} <b>({{ zl_value | money_without_trailing_zeros }} value)</b></span></p>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <a class="zt-ch__cta" href="#" data-zt-cta>
        <span data-zt-cta-label>Add to cart</span>
        <span class="zt-ch__cta-sep" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
        <span class="zt-ch__cta-price" data-zt-cta-price></span>
      </a>
      <p class="zt-ch__note" data-zt-summary aria-live="polite"></p>
      {%- if zt_ch_blend and zt_gb_card -%}
        {%- comment -%} Nov 21 2026 5:17 AM CT (Dana): Protein Blends only. Guarantee + shipping in the same box as the product pages (zt-trust--blend in snippets/zt-buybox-tidy.liquid): shield + guarantee on the left, truck + shipping on the right. {%- endcomment -%}
        <ul class="zt-ch__trust" role="list">
          <li class="zt-ch__trust-g"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 9-8 11-4.5-2-8-6-8-11V5z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg><span>30-day money-back guarantee on our protein blends.</span></li>
          <li class="zt-ch__trust-s"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2.5 5.5h9v8h-9zM11.5 8.5h3.2l2.3 2.6v2.4h-5.5"/><circle cx="6" cy="14.6" r="1.4"/><circle cx="14.2" cy="14.6" r="1.4"/></svg><span><b>Ships in 1&ndash;2</b> business days</span></li>
        </ul>
      {%- elsif zt_ch_blend and section.settings.guarantee_text != blank -%}
        <p class="zt-ch__guar{% if zt_gb_card %} zt-ch__guar--inline{% endif %}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 9-8 11-4.5-2-8-6-8-11V5z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg><span>{% if zt_gb_card %}{{ section.settings.guarantee_text | replace: 'guarantee ', 'guarantee&nbsp;' }}{% else %}{{ section.settings.guarantee_text }}{% endif %}</span></p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- liquid
  assign zt_faq_set = section.settings.faq_set
  if zt_faq_set == 'auto'
    assign zt_faq_set = 'all'
    assign zt_has_cacao = false
    for b in section.blocks
      if b.type == 'option' and b.settings.product != blank and b.settings.product.handle contains 'cacao'
        assign zt_has_cacao = true
      endif
    endfor
    if zt_has_cacao == false
      assign zt_faq_set = 'vegan'
    endif
  endif
-%}
